  "descriptionMarkdown": "### Introduction\n\nA comprehensive mall that can be built at a very early stage, producing a wide variety of logistics and production items on Navuis.\n\nI created this as a compact motherbase for my tiny train grid (64x64) but found it's also convenient for starting the game.\n\nBecause it uses a single belt for delivering mixed ingredients, it is very easy to change/extend the items to be made.\n\n### Starting Requirements\n- Yellow belts\n- Yellow inserters\n- Assembly Machine 1\n- Medium electric pole (can be replaced by small electric pole, but more)\n- Some assembly machine 2 (for handling fluids) and one electric furnace can be built later\n\nUpgrading to better belts, assembly machines, and inserters will improve production rate.\n\n## What It Builds\n\n### Logistics\nEverything on Navuis, except:\n- Wooden chest\n- Burner inserter\n- Small electric pole\n- Artillery wagon\n- Spidertron\n- Ice platform\n- Foundation\n- Cliff explosives\n\n### Production\nEverything on Navuis, except:\n- Burner mining drill\n- Artillery tower\n- Biolab\n- Lightning rod\n- Tier 2/3 modules",
